{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05165","headline":"秋夜陪张丞相赵侍御游㴩湖二首 一 · 尹懋","name":"秋夜陪张丞相赵侍御游㴩湖二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"熊轼巴陵地，鷁舟湘水浔。\n江山与势远，泉石自幽深。\n杳霭入天壑，冥茫见道心。\n超然无俗事，清宴有空林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹懋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}